---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import DraftBanner from '../components/DraftBanner.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy (draft)" description="Draft privacy policy for Rconn, to be reviewed." noindex>
  <div class="wrap page-head">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <DraftBanner />
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        A privacy policy for Rconn hasn’t been written yet. When it is, it will replace this
        page. Until then, the <a href="/security">security page</a> describes technically what
        the Rconn server can and can’t see.
      </p>
      <h2>Topics the policy will cover</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>What the Rconn server handles to connect devices, and how long it’s kept</li>
        <li>What this website collects</li>
        <li>Who runs the service and how to contact them</li>
        <li>Your rights over your data</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
